## Hardware License Note

The hardware design files (schematics, PCB layouts, Gerber files, and BOM) in
the `/hardware/` directory are also licensed under the MIT License. This means
you are free to:

- Manufacture the SUNFLEX-HC PCB for personal or commercial use
- Modify the design for your own applications
- Sell products based on the SUNFLEX-HC design
- Distribute modified versions of the hardware

We ask (but do not require) that you:
- Attribute the SUNFLEX-HC project
- Share improvements back to the community
- Use a different name for derivative products to avoid confusion

