This project uses third-party libraries and tools that have their own licenses:

- **ESP-IDF** (Espressif) — Apache License 2.0
- **Arduino Core for ESP32** — LGPL 2.1
- **GreenPAK Designer IP** (Renesas) — Subject to Renesas terms
- **KiCad Libraries** — CC-BY-SA 4.0

Please respect the licenses of these dependencies when using SUNFLEX-HC.
